ERROR:  relation "concur_temp" does not exist
---END---
---START---
DROP INDEX CONCURRENTLY concur_temp_ind;
ERROR:  index "concur_temp_ind" does not exist
---END---
---START---
DROP TABLE concur_temp;
ERROR:  table "concur_temp" does not exist
---END---
---START---
